   967  /*
   968   * Accepts a string file format (sam, bam, cram, vcf, bam) optionally
   969   * followed by a comma separated list of key=value options and splits
   970   * these up into the fields of htsFormat struct.
   971   *
   972   * format is assumed to be already initialised, either to blank
   973   * "unknown" values or via previous hts_opt_add calls.
